ers and how we see them as well  as we know most of them they're all sort  of in unfamiliar territory one thing i  liked better about this episode was that  a lot of what i was thinking about in  the previous one and brought up in my  last video seemed to get addressed here  sometimes it was just indirectly but it  seems like things are moving in the  right direction that said danny kind of  went from bad to worse but at least now  he's a wild card for the mission they  did establish his talent we watched him  get brave and saved the day last week  and at the same time he's got this  unhealthy obsession for karen that can't  take him anywhere good it's the one  lukewarm story point for me right now  but there's time for it to turn around  to become something else and i think  that is a good place to leave things  let me know in the comments what you  thought about this episode how you feel  about the season so far and where you  think things are going next please like  this video if you enjoyed it please  subscribe to my channel if you haven't  already and thanks for watching i'll  talk to you soon

